{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発売だった 『BUBKA』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、さゆにゃん、伊織、中田の4人で\n埼玉トークしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉について語ったのは久々だねー＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元トークになるので\n私たちの過去も覗けちゃう感じになってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/01/7861776/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n埼玉出身の人はあるある～って感じで読めるし\n埼玉出身じゃなくても面白いと思う！\n読んでね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じく埼玉出身の琴子が別ページに載ってるけど\n美人過ぎてやばいから\n是非そっちも合わせて見てね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/01/7861776/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46応援力チャージプロジェクト』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画が2つアップされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/01/7861776/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『「乃木坂の詩」ダンスレクチャー2016』\nhttps://youtu.be/Pin1GeO-Sk8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のライブに来たことあるかたは知ってると思うけど\n乃木坂の詩はライブではほぼやる楽曲だし、\nみんなで一緒に踊る楽曲になってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振付まだ覚えてないよ～って方は\n是非これを見て練習してください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/01/7861776/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/01/7861776/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイキング第三弾\nhttps://youtu.be/jLRRls-uNJY"},